915
00:36:45,400 --> 00:36:47,080
I wonder what other tricks he has up his sleeve,

916
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:48,160
and I don't know

917
00:36:49,080 --> 00:36:50,040
if the Hurricane Battalion can

918
00:36:50,040 --> 00:36:51,160
