1032
00:40:35,800 --> 00:40:37,360
This time and the last time

1033
00:40:38,480 --> 00:40:39,880
are strikingly similar.

1034
00:40:43,920 --> 00:40:44,640
It seems

1035
00:40:45,200 --> 00:40:46,480
Brigade Commander Di has also

1036
00:40:47,040 --> 00:40:48,920
