1057
00:41:35,960 --> 00:41:36,520
Move.

1058
00:41:36,600 --> 00:41:37,160
Hurry up.

1059
00:41:37,600 --> 00:41:38,960
I can walk. Stop pulling me.

1060
00:41:39,320 --> 00:41:39,800
Move.

1061
00:41:40,160 --> 00:41:41,320
Speak of

1062
